Short:        One kit to build for the Open platform
Uploader:     (We fill this in at upload time)
Author:       AmigaChrome Team
Type:         dev/misc
Version:      0.1
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.2.0
Distribution: Aminet

The Open SDK holds what you need to write programs for AmigaOS 3.2.x with the
Open libraries: headers, function tables, link libraries, autodocs, examples
and ACKitchen templates, each building for AmigaOS 3.2 and AROS.

It sits beside the NDK 3.2, the AROS SDK, the OS 4 SDK and MUI's SDK, never
instead of them, and uses only published interfaces with names that port.

Status: designed, not built; this readme is ready for the first release.

Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 AmigaChrome Team, for our files; third-party
code keeps its own. If you build on it, we ask that you credit the AmigaChrome Team
and AmigaChrome.

Source: https://github.com/DalsinAI/openamigasdk
